  "summaries": {
    "en": "Ability synergy routing, shrine efficiency, Depths navigation, and boss preparation for a clean playthrough of Tears of the Kingdom.",
    "ja": "能力シナジー、祠効率ルート、地底エリア踏破、ボス準備まで無駄のないプレイを実現する攻略指針。"
  },
  "category": "adventure",
